# The whole working folder is versioned here, by the owner's instruction
# (2026-09-20): the repository is the folder, so a coworker or another agent
# clones it and has everything -- the engine, the published specifications, the
# working notes and the live case material.
#
# The repository is PRIVATE and must stay private.  It carries real assignments:
# borrower and owner names, property addresses, loan and order numbers, an
# appraiser's licence number and signature images.  Making it public would
# publish all of that.
#
# Only machine-generated junk is excluded below -- nothing that carries work.

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
node_modules/
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# a la mode's own form bundle, cached by total-bridge/tools/form_model.py and by
# investigations: it is their code, not ours -- only the tables we extract from
# it are kept (knowledge/total/builds/).
total-bridge/tools/.cache/
_work/woodycrest/total_index.js
